From: cbodotnet maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve the explicit source acquisition adapter command

The retired Darc package is unavailable. Keep the normal FetchSources target,
but retain an explicitly supplied immutable adapter wrapper instead of replacing
it with the obsolete default during GetCommonDarcCloneCommand execution.

diff --git a/Directory.Build.targets b/Directory.Build.targets
--- a/Directory.Build.targets
+++ b/Directory.Build.targets
@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@
       <!-- depth 0 should be sufficient for us since we explictly declare all our dependencies -->
       <DarcCloneArguments>$(DarcCloneArguments) --depth 0</DarcCloneArguments>
 
-      <DarcCloneCommand>$(DotNetCliToolDir)dotnet $(DarcDll) clone $(DarcCloneArguments)</DarcCloneCommand>
+      <DarcCloneCommand Condition="'$(DarcCloneCommand)' == ''">$(DotNetCliToolDir)dotnet $(DarcDll) clone $(DarcCloneArguments)</DarcCloneCommand>
     </PropertyGroup>
   </Target>
 
